as published. Rolling Desk was not overwritten because the connector returned the existing minified desk-latest payload truncated; replacing it without the full source would risk deleting verified articles."},"items":[{"id":"football-arsenal-konsa-complete-2000","deskSlugs":["football"],"section":"Football｜Premier League／轉會","status":"NEW","title":"Arsenal正式完成£51m簽入Ezri Konsa，四年合約補強後防深度","dek":"英格蘭國腳由Aston Villa轉投英超冠軍；交易由較早的「達成協議」推進至正式完成，屬19:18 baseline後的新狀態。","summary":"The Guardian在約19:15 HKT更新確認Arsenal已完成Ezri Konsa交易，轉會費£51m、合約四年。Sky Sports較早已獨立確認兩會達成相同金額協議，並指出Arsenal在William Saliba與Jurrien Timber受傷後一直尋求能兼任中堅及右閘的補強。","body":"Arsenal在新季英超揭幕戰前正式完成Ezri Konsa轉會。The Guardian於英國時間11:15左右更新，確認這名28歲英格蘭國腳由Aston Villa加盟，轉會費為£51m，簽下四年合約。Sky Sports此前已獨立報道兩會就相同金額達成協議，並指出Villa原先估值約£60m，最終雙方找到折衷。\n\n這宗交易的即時意義在於Arsenal後防傷兵。William Saliba預計缺陣較長時間，Jurrien Timber亦受腹股溝傷勢影響，Konsa能同時出任中堅與右閘，直接增加Mikel Arteta的輪換彈性。交易完成狀態比19:18 HKT前的「協議／接近完成」更進一步，因此列作本輪真正incremental news，而不是重複刊登早前轉會傳聞。","context":"Arsenal以英超衛冕冠軍身份進入2026/27球季，但後防在開季前受到Saliba及Timber傷勢影響。Konsa過去在Villa及英格蘭隊累積大量英超與國際賽經驗。","why":"交易由協議階段正式轉為完成，改變Arsenal可用後防人腳，並影響Villa後續尋找中堅替代者的轉會部署。","watchNext":"留意Konsa是否趕及註冊及進入對Coventry的大名單、Arsenal後續前場收購，以及Aston Villa會否迅速簽入替代中堅。","sourceName":"The Guardian","sourceUrl":"https://www.theguardian.com/football/live/2026/aug/21/premier-league-returns-with-arsenal-v-coventry-transfer-news-and-more-football-live","timeLabel":"21 Aug 2026 · 約19:15 HKT","sources":[{"name":"The Guardian","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/football/live/2026/aug/21/premier-league-returns-with-arsenal-v-coventry-transfer-news-and-more-football-live"},{"name":"Sky Sports","url":"https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11670/13574724/ezri-konsa-transfer-news-arsenal-agree-deal-with-aston-villa-to-sign-england-defender"}]}]}